Package: tTEscanR
Title: An advanced R-based package to quantify and visualize translation efficiency from sequencing data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ana", "Varas-Sánchez", , "ana.varas@scilifelab.se", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: Tools to compute codon usage from mRNA and anticodon usage from tRNA data.
    Includes pre-processing and visualization options cover the user needs.
    Allows to analyze bulk and single-cell sequencing data.
    Expands the previously published tTE pipeline (GitHub - wgao688/sc_tRNA_mRNA).
